'''Siamese Lynxes''', also called '''Bagheera & Azrael''', are [[Mythological Creature]]s that can be spawned from [[Griffin Burrows]] during the [[Mythological Ritual]].

== Spawning ==
'''Siamese Lynxes''' can be spawned by digging up [[Griffin Burrows]] with a {{Item|Griffin Pet}} equipped.

