== Trivia ==
* Azrael is likely based on the cat in [[w:List of The Smurfs characters#Antagonists|The Smurfs]]. It inherits also its name directly from the Islamic and Jewish traditions of Azrael, the Angel of Death.
* Bagheera is most likely based on Bagheera the black panther in The Jungle Book.
* One of the cats is internally named Siamese Cat in vanilla ''Minecraft''.
* As all other mobs, they can be [[Runic]], either one or both of them.
* They used to be able to eat {{Item|Voodoo Doll}}s, due to it being a [[mcw:Pufferfish|Pufferfish]].
**This may have inspired their effect on the {{Item|Tasty Cat Food}}.
* There is a slight chance that Azrael will not spawn and both of the cats will be named Bagheera.

== Bugs ==
* While the {{Common}} {{Item|Griffin Pet}} is equipped, any Siamese Lynxes found in a [[Griffin Burrow]] will have the prefix {{Dark Green|Default}}, as opposed to the {{MobSprite|Minos Hunter}}, which has no prefix. 

